From 06cf99eaf52aa61c59d29ca4df9ac0a472edb0f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] lotus_v2: add MonadDB 16-shard parallel Merklix batch updates
 and async MDBX prefetch

Partition top-4-bit Merklix subtrees (256 roots across 16 worker shards)
for parallel SmtBatchUpdateParallel execution and add software prefetch
hints for MDBX B+tree pages.
